          "text": "Expanded indication to include virologically-suppressed patients on a stable antiretroviral regimen switching to replace their current regimen",
          "citations": [
            {
              "quote": "This Prior Approval supplemental new drug application updates the Indications and Usage section of the Prescribing Information (PI) to include patients who are virologically-suppressed (HIV-1 RNA &lt;50 copies/mL) on a stable antiretroviral regimen for at least 6 months with no history of treatment failure in order to replace their current regimen. Patients should have no known substitutions associated with resistance to the individual components of STRIBILD.",
